                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Organize tasks into workspaces, lists, and collapsible sections. Nest however deep makes sense.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-gray-950/50">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 14.25v-2.625a3.375 3.375 0 0 0-3.375-3.375h-1.5A1.125 1.125 0 0 1 13.5 7.125v-1.5a3.375 3.375 0 0 0-3.375-3.375H8.25m0 12.75h7.5m-7.5 3H12M10.5 2.25H5.625c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v17.25c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125h12.75c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V11.25a9 9 0 0 0-9-9Z"/></svg>
                    </div>
