                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Break tasks down as deep as you need. Subtasks have their own subtasks, comments, attachments, and due dates.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-gray-950/50">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 3.75v4.5m0-4.5h4.5m-4.5 0L9 9M3.75 20.25v-4.5m0 4.5h4.5m-4.5 0L9 15M20.25 3.75h-4.5m4.5 0v4.5m0-4.5L15 9m5.25 11.25h-4.5m4.5 0v-4.5m0 4.5L15 15"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">Drag & Drop</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Reorder tasks and sections by dragging. Move tasks between lists. Touch-friendly on mobile.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-gray-950/50">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
