                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">Due Dates & Priorities</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Set deadlines and priority levels. See overdue, due today, and upcoming at a glance from your dashboard.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-gray-950/50">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.568 3H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 3 5.25v4.318c0 .597.237 1.17.659 1.591l9.581 9.581c.699.699 1.78.872 2.607.33a18.095 18.095 0 0 0 5.223-5.223c.542-.827.369-1.908-.33-2.607L11.16 3.66A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 9.568 3Z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 6h.008v.008H6V6Z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">Tags & Search</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Tag tasks freely. Search everything with <kbd class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300">Cmd+K</kbd> — tasks, lists, spaces, tags.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-gray-950/50">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M18.375 12.739l-7.693 7.693a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-6.364-6.364l10.94-10.94A3 3 0 1 1 19.5 7.372L8.552 18.32m.009-.01-.01.01m5.699-9.941-7.81 7.81a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2.112 2.13"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">Attachments</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Attach files to tasks and subtasks. S3-compatible storage — use any provider or self-host with MinIO.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-gray-950/50">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7.5 8.25h9m-9 3H12m-9.75 1.51c0 1.6 1.123 2.994 2.707 3.227 1.129.166 2.27.293 3.423.379.35.026.67.21.865.501L12 21l2.755-4.133a1.14 1.14 0 0 1 .865-.501 48.172 48.172 0 0 0 3.423-.379c1.584-.233 2.707-1.626 2.707-3.228V6.741c0-1.602-1.123-2.995-2.707-3.228A48.394 48.394 0 0 0 12 3c-2.392 0-4.744.175-7.043.513C3.373 3.746 2.25 5.14 2.25 6.741v6.018Z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">Comments & Markdown</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Discuss tasks with rich markdown comments. Edit, delete, and link to other tasks inline.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-gray-950/50">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14.857 17.082a23.848 23.848 0 0 0 5.454-1.31A8.967 8.967 0 0 1 18 9.75V9A6 6 0 0 0 6 9v.75a8.967 8.967 0 0 1-2.312 6.022c1.733.64 3.56 1.085 5.455 1.31m5.714 0a24.255 24.255 0 0 1-5.714 0m5.714 0a3 3 0 1 1-5.714 0"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">Notifications</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Stay on top of overdue tasks and activity. Read/unread tracking. No push notification spam.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-gray-950/50">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 13.125C3 12.504 3.504 12 4.125 12h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v6.75C7.5 20.496 6.996 21 6.375 21h-2.25A1.125 1.125 0 0 1 3 19.875v-6.75ZM9.75 8.625c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v11.25c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 0 1-1.125-1.125V8.625ZM16.5 4.125c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25C20.496 3 21 3.504 21 4.125v15.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 0 1-1.125-1.125V4.125Z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">Dashboard & Stats</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">See completions, overdue counts, and trends. Export lists as plain text or CSV anytime.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Keyboard-first -->
    <section class="py-20 px-6 border-t border-white/5">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
            <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Built for keyboard warriors.</h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 mb-8">Vim-style navigation, numeric prefixes, and single-key actions. Your hands never leave the keyboard.</p>
                    <div class="space-y-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                            <div class="flex gap-1">
                                <kbd class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-sm text-slate-300 font-mono">j</kbd>
                                <kbd class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-sm text-slate-300 font-mono">k</kbd>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-sm text-slate-400">Navigate up / down</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                            <kbd class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-sm text-slate-300 font-mono">x</kbd>
                            <span class="text-sm text-slate-400">Toggle complete</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                            <kbd class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-sm text-slate-300 font-mono">e</kbd>
                            <span class="text-sm text-slate-400">Edit title inline</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                            <kbd class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-sm text-slate-300 font-mono">n</kbd>
                            <span class="text-sm text-slate-400">Quick add task</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                            <kbd class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-sm text-slate-300 font-mono">d</kbd>
                            <span class="text-sm text-slate-400">Set due date</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                            <div class="flex gap-1">
                                <kbd class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-sm text-slate-300 font-mono">G</kbd>
                                <kbd class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-sm text-slate-300 font-mono">g</kbd><kbd class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-sm text-slate-300 font-mono">g</kbd>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-sm text-slate-400">Jump to last / first</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                            <div class="flex gap-1">
                                <kbd class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-sm text-slate-300 font-mono">3</kbd><kbd class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-sm text-slate-300 font-mono">j</kbd>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-sm text-slate-400">Numeric prefix — move 3 down</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                            <kbd class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-sm text-slate-300 font-mono">?</kbd>
                            <span class="text-sm text-slate-400">Show all shortcuts</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-gray-950 overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="aspect-video flex items-center justify-center text-slate-600 text-sm p-8">Keyboard shortcuts screenshot goes here</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Self-host -->
    <section class="py-20 px-6 border-t border-white/5">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
            <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Self-host in 60 seconds.</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-400 mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto">SQLite database, no external dependencies. One command to deploy. Your data never leaves your server.</p>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-gray-950 p-6 sm:p-8 text-left max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
                    <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-500/60"></div>
                    <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500/60"></div>
                    <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-500/60"></div>
                    <span class="ml-2 text-xs text-slate-500">terminal</span>
                </div>
                <pre class="text-sm sm:text-base font-mono"><code><span class="text-slate-500">$</span> <span class="text-indigo-400">git clone</span> <span class="text-slate-300">https://github.com/mattmezza/todoer.pro</span>
<span class="text-slate-500">$</span> <span class="text-indigo-400">cd</span> <span class="text-slate-300">todoer.pro</span>
<span class="text-slate-500">$</span> <span class="text-indigo-400">docker compose up</span> <span class="text-slate-300">-d</span>
<span class="text-green-400">✓ todoer is running at localhost:8000</span></code></pre>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Tech stack + Security -->
    <section class="py-20 px-6 border-t border-white/5">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
            <div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Built with boring tech.</h2>
                <p class="text-slate-400 mb-6">No JS framework. No build step for the frontend. Server-rendered HTML, enhanced with HTMX. Simple stack, easy to hack on.</p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                    <span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-sm text-slate-300">Python 3.14+</span>
                    <span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-sm text-slate-300">FastAPI</span>
                    <span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-sm text-slate-300">HTMX</span>
                    <span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-sm text-slate-300">Alpine.js</span>
                    <span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-sm text-slate-300">JinjaX</span>
                    <span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-sm text-slate-300">SQLite</span>
                    <span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-sm text-slate-300">Tailwind CSS</span>
                    <span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-sm text-slate-300">Docker</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Security built in.</h2>
                <p class="text-slate-400 mb-6">Not an afterthought. Auth and data protection are first-class concerns from day one.</p>
                <ul class="space-y-3">
